{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get fired up. Strategy is individuality.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since 1985, the <i>Daisenryaku</i> series has defined modern war strategy games. On every battlefield, victory hinges on how you deploy forces, balance offense and defense, and break the deadlock\u2014your \u201cGrand Strategy\u201d is put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/388155e8a7321d98d8bc1b0c6203c817.avif?t=1768185986\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ Units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of more than 300 units\u2014fighters, tanks, assault ships, and ASW aircraft\u2014drawn straight from today\u2019s active forces. Cutting-edge weapons still in development also make their debut, letting you experience the future of modern warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/e0a3dc445216f6992505dfc6ba2f3103.avif?t=1768185986\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based System for Careful Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold on hex-based maps, with players and CPU taking turns. Lead your fleet across the seas, seize the skies with aircraft, advance over land with tanks\u2014your careful planning shapes the course of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/ee2215e93d7fa9f2d196c0cc7208cea8.avif?t=1768185986\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>50 Brand-New Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 50 entirely new maps. From small islands suited for light play to large-scale battlefields for total war, both newcomers and experienced players can take their time and enjoy strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/5a670b0f5128d984323769776526045d.avif?t=1768185986\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/2cb5c74ae6608bd18aaee5705b40b621.avif?t=1768185986\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941780?t=1768185986","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/ab6da0dcad25488bfc2bef7030e5d85ffd168d46/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768185986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/3b5c137c63331b2e2ce6076a9d47e7ea325c101c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768185986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/3b5c137c63331b2e2ce6076a9d47e7ea325c101c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768185986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get fired up. Strategy is individuality.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since 1985, the <i>Daisenryaku</i> series has defined modern war strategy games. On every battlefield, victory hinges on how you deploy forces, balance offense and defense, and break the deadlock\u2014your \u201cGrand Strategy\u201d is put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\